  "jei.ultimatearmoury.armor.mushashite.info": "First tier of the mod. Cap and Shirt together grant Luck I. Undies and Socks together grant half an extra heart. Forged from Mushashite Ingots and the Heart Of The Fallen.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.armor.joanfoite.info": "Second tier. Cap and Shirt together grant Water Breathing. Undies and Socks together grant Speed II. With the full set Piglins won't attack you and Creepers can't see you. Upgraded from the Mushashite piece with the Heart Of The Ghosts.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.armor.nadienite.info": "Top tier. The Cap grants Night Vision, the Shirt grants Resistance III and creative flight, the Undies grant Jump Boost III and the Socks Speed III. With the full set Piglins won't attack you, Creepers can't see you, Endermen can't teleport and Phantoms are friendly. Upgraded from the JoanFoite piece with the Heart Of The Elite.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.tools.mushashite.info": "First tier tools. Unbreakable, with permanent Efficiency and Fortune IV. Forged from Mushashite Ingots, sticks and the Heart Of The Fallen.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.tools.joanfoite.info": "Second tier tools. Unbreakable, with permanent Efficiency and Fortune VII. Upgraded from the Mushashite tool with the Heart Of The Ghosts.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.tools.nadienite.info": "Top tier tools. Unbreakable, with permanent Efficiency and Fortune X and the fastest mining speed in the mod. Upgraded from the JoanFoite tool with the Heart Of The Elite.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.material.mushashite.info": "First tier material, light blue. Its ore is the most common of the three and spawns between Y -48 and Y 48. Mining it drops Raw Mushashite, which smelts into an ingot.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.material.joanfoite.info": "Second tier material, purple. Its ore is less common and spawns between Y -64 and Y 16. Mining it drops Raw JoanFoite, which smelts into an ingot.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.material.nadienite.info": "Top tier material, lime green. Its ore is the rarest and only spawns between Y -64 and Y -8. Mining it drops Raw Nadienite, which smelts into an ingot.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.heart.mushashite.info": "Key to the Mushashite tier. Rarely dropped by Zombies and Skeletons, and much more often by Wither Skeletons.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.heart.joanfoite.info": "Key to the JoanFoite tier. Dropped by Phantoms, Ghasts and Vexes.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.heart.nadienite.info": "Key to the Nadienite tier. Dropped by Elder Guardians, and guaranteed from the Wither, the Warden and the Ender Dragon.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.steel_nugget.info": "One ninth of a Steel Ingot. Nine nuggets craft back into an ingot.",
  "jei.ultimatearmoury.netherite_nugget.info": "One ninth of a Netherite Ingot. Nine nuggets craft back into an ingot.",
